    "voice": "produce_events/300300503/3003005030040"
  },
  {
    "id": 3003005030050,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "本当！？　やったー！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300300503/3003005030050"
  },
  {
    "id": 3003005030060,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……めぐる、ちょっと喜びすぎじゃない？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300300503/3003005030060"
  },
  {
    "id": 3003005030070,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "だって嬉しいんだもん！　実はね、灯織に褒めてもらうのが\r\n最近のわたしの目標だったんだ",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300300503/3003005030070"
  },
  {
    "id": 3003005030080,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "私に……？",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300300503/3003005030080"
  },
  {
    "id": 3003005030090,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "うん！　……自分の基準で見るより、\r\n灯織に見てもらった方が上手くなれるって思ったから！",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300300503/3003005030090"
  },
  {
    "id": 3003005030100,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "灯織、わたしたちのことよく見てくれてるでしょ？\r\n自分じゃ気づけないことも、灯織なら見逃さないかなって",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300300503/3003005030100"
  },
  {
    "id": 3003005030110,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……私、そんなんじゃない\r\nまだまだ足りないところ、いっぱいあるし……",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300300503/3003005030110"
  },
  {
    "id": 3003005030120,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "んーん、そういうことじゃなくて\r\n灯織はさ、何かをできたって思う時の基準が高いんだよ",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300300503/3003005030120"
  },
  {
    "id": 3003005030130,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "わたしや真乃ができたなって思っても、\r\n灯織にとってはまだ足りない時がある",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300300503/3003005030130"
  },
  {
    "id": 3003005030140,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "だったら、灯織のオッケーが出たら\r\nそれは百点満点ってことでしょ？",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300300503/3003005030140"
  },
  {
    "id": 3003005030150,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "だから灯織に見てもらいたいし、褒めてもらいたいんだよっ",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300300503/3003005030150"
  },
  {
    "id": 3003005030160,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……私って、細かいのかな",
    "charAnim1": "sad3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300300503/3003005030160"
  },
  {
    "id": 3003005030170,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "うん",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300300503/3003005030170"
  },
  {
    "id": 3003005030180,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "！　やっぱり…………",
    "charAnim1": "shy3",
    "charAnim2": "face_cry",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300300503/3003005030180"
  },
  {
    "id": 3003005030190,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "でもそれって、イルミネーションスターズにとって\r\n必要なんだと思うんだ",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300300503/3003005030190"
  },
  {
    "id": 3003005030200,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "今は灯織に任せっきりにしちゃってるけどね",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300300503/3003005030200"
  },
  {
    "id": 3003005030210,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad_s",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300300503/3003005030210"
  },
  {
    "id": 3003005030220,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "よぉし、そろそろ休憩にしよう！\r\n……はい灯織、お水っ",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300300503/3003005030220"
  },
  {
    "id": 3003005030230,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "ありがとう……\r\n…………ふう",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300300503/3003005030230"
  },
  {
    "id": 3003005030240,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "前はこのくらい続けて練習してたら\r\n動きが乱れちゃったりもしてたけど",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300300503/3003005030240"
  },
  {
    "id": 3003005030250,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "今日は通しでもなんとかなってるよね\r\nこれって、頑張ってきた成果って言っていいのかな？",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300300503/3003005030250"
  },
  {
    "id": 3003005030260,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……うん。そう思う",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300300503/3003005030260"
  },
  {
    "id": 3003005030270,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "……灯織？　どうかした？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300300503/3003005030270"
  },
  {
    "id": 3003005030280,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "あ、ううん、なんでも……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300300503/3003005030280"
  },
  {
    "id": 3003005030290,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "本当に？　……よかったら、話してほしいな",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300300503/3003005030290"
  },
  {
    "id": 3003005030300,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad_s",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300300503/3003005030300"
  },
  {
    "id": 3003005030310,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……その、前に３人でレッスンしてた時のことを\r\n思い出して……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300300503/3003005030310"
  },
  {
    "id": 3003005030320,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "あの時の私、ふたりの努力をまったく考えずに\r\nきついこと言っちゃって",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300300503/3003005030320"
  },
  {
    "id": 3003005030330,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "上手く合わないのは、ふたりのアイドルへの気持ちが\r\n足りてないせいだって決めつけて──",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300300503/3003005030330"
  },
  {
    "id": 3003005030340,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "灯織違うよ、それは──！",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300300503/3003005030340"
  },
  {
    "id": 3003005030350,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "お願い、最後まで聞いて",
    "charAnim1": "sad3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300300503/3003005030350"
  },
  {
    "id": 3003005030360,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "……うん",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300300503/3003005030360"
  },
  {
    "id": 3003005030370,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……私、ふたりのこと、全然知ろうとしてなかった",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300300503/3003005030370"
  },
  {
    "id": 3003005030380,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "ふたりがこっそり特訓してるなんて\r\n考えもしなかったし……",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300300503/3003005030380"
  },
  {
    "id": 3003005030390,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "きついことしか言えない私となんて\r\n一緒にはやりたくないんだって思ってた",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300300503/3003005030390"
  },
  {
    "id": 3003005030400,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "ふたりのことも、ふたりのアイドルへの気持ちも、\r\n信じられてなかったんだ",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300300503/3003005030400"
  },
  {
    "id": 3003005030410,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……一緒には頑張れないのかもって、\r\n勝手に思い込んでた",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300300503/3003005030410"
  },
  {
    "id": 3003005030420,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "…………",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad_s",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300300503/3003005030420"
  },
  {
    "id": 3003005030430,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "それってすごく失礼なことだって、今ならわかる\r\nだから、ずっと謝りたかった",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300300503/3003005030430"
  },
  {
    "id": 3003005030440,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "真乃は、気にしてないって言ってくれたけど……\r\nそれでもやっぱり、あの時の自分が許せなくて",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300300503/3003005030440"
  },
  {
    "id": 3003005030450,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "あの時、あんな言い方をしてしまったこと、\r\nあんなふうに思ってしまったこと",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300300503/3003005030450"
  },
  {
    "id": 3003005030460,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……本当に、ごめんなさい",
    "charAnim1": "sad3",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300300503/3003005030460"
  },
  {
    "id": 3003005030470,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "こんなこと言うのも……勝手だよね",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300300503/3003005030470"
  },
  {
    "id": 3003005030480,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "……灯織\r\nやっぱりわたし、灯織のこと大好き！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300300503/3003005030480"
  },
  {
    "id": 3003005030490,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "え？　きゅ、急に何？",
    "charAnim1": "shy3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300300503/3003005030490"
  },
  {
    "id": 3003005030500,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "なんでもっ！　わたしは灯織が大好きだし、\r\n真乃だってきっとおんなじ！",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300300503/3003005030500"
  },
  {
    "id": 3003005030510,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "真面目で、真っ直ぐで、今みたいにわたしと真乃のこと\r\n一生懸命考えてくれる灯織が大好き！",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300300503/3003005030510"
  },
  {
    "id": 3003005030520,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "め、めぐるはまたそんな……\r\n聞いてるこっちが恥ずかしいよ",
